  "notes": "Track table rows are each drawn as white 12px-rounded cards with 2px light border on a #f6f6f6 canvas, giving a list-of-cards look while keeping column alignment. Quality badges use amber outline for Lossless/Hi-Res and gray outline for HQ/SQ. Dark-brown #2c1513 is the primary tone (filled liked hearts, icons, player progress line). Controls are circular 36px gray-filled pills. Sort is reached via the 标题 column header which opens a radio popover (sort key + direction); overflow menu offers 批量管理 (bulk manage) entry. Floating locate-current-track button bottom right. Desktop window controls (min/max/close) in top bar indicate an Electron-style app."
